                                "sense_id": "1531a270-fe11-39ff-ab9f-913af3d3f7b5",
                                "text": "With ſence whereof whileſt ſo thy ſoftened ſpirit\nIs inly toucht, and humbled with meeke zeale,\nThrough meditation of his endleſſe merit,\nLift vp thy mind to th’ author of thy weale,\nAnd to his ſoueraine mercie doe appeale;\nLearne him to loue, that loued thee ſo deare,"
